# Placeholder so the visual-baselines directory exists in git.
#
# Baseline PNGs are written here by:
#   node scripts/visual-baseline.mjs
#
# CI compares actual screenshots against the files here using:
#   node scripts/visual-diff.mjs
#
# Subdirectories created at runtime:
#   __actual/   the current run's screenshots
#   __diffs/    pixelmatch red-pixel diff PNGs
#
# Both are uploaded as the `visual-diffs` workflow artifact.
